# Twenty-eighth bounded final-seat desk

Author: `/root/twenty_eighth_finite_scout`, 2026-09-07 UTC.
Author disposition: **HOLD_PROOF_SOURCE / NO_PROMOTION**.

This work owns only this directory and continues the final open seat of the
existing P204-start batch. It assigns no paper number, reserve, candidate
gate, new batch, next lane, external upload, contact or Git operation.

## One literal, no scientific execution

**CTM — cubic transpose multiplication.** For every odd prime power $q$,
the carrier is the entire four-entry space $M_2(\mathbb F_q)$, in its fixed
ordered basis. The autonomous update is

$$T(A)=A^{\mathsf T}A^2.$$

There is no invertibility assumption, normalization, clipping, sequential
entry update, external parameter estimated from an orbit, or variable
schedule. All four entries interact through the literal matrix products.
The determinant-zero and determinant-one/skew-fixed sets considered in
PROOF_PACKAGE.md are proof strata of this single carrier, not alternative
candidate definitions or proposals to fill a seat by restriction.

Only this literal was taken into proof triage. Broad historical search
terms included chip firing/diffusion, solitaire, tournament reversal,
local complementation, Euclidean maps, matrix words and commutators;
comparison entries discovered in old ledgers are not new attempted rules.
Exactly one attempted literal, zero declared pilots, zero finite boxes,
zero scientific kernels, zero scientific producer runs and zero numerical
canonical/replay pairs are claimed. The four-definition/two-pilot ceilings
are not quotas. The hand calculations in the proof are deductions.

## Why it is not promoted

The full one-step source set has an exact disjoint coordinate decoder and
an evaluated linear/conic kernel. Its zero-target fibre is $q^2$ when
$-1$ is nonsquare and $3q^2-2q$ when $-1$ is square. Those are author
deductions, not an independent value acceptance.

The determinant factor $d\mapsto d^3$ is not a temporal classification.
Already the invariant $d=1$, skew-$k$ stratum maps surjectively by trace
onto $s\mapsto s^3+(k^2-3)s$. No complete all-$q$ recurrent/temporal
classification of the full matrix carrier was obtained. A singular-sector
power formula, generic finite-map enumeration or a larger finite box would
not close that missing axis. Direct owner clearance is also not established.
The root's follow-up requests this narrow negative/hold, not another lane.

